  "title": "Grilled Greek Yogurt Marinated Chicken",
  "description": "This Greek yogurt marinade with lemon, garlic, and herbs is from Chef John. It makes the most amazing grilled chicken you&#39;ll want to make all summer long!",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
